ROBERT REDFORD as Martin Bishop
================================
Robert Redford stars as Martin Bishop, a former
radical who now runs a team of security experts.

DAN AYKROYD as Mother
=====================
Dan Aykroyd plays the conspiracy-obsessed
electronics expert.

SIDNEY POITIER as Donald Crease
==============================
Sidney Poitier plays the ex-CIA operative.

DAVID STRATHAIRN as Whistler
============================
David Strathairn plays the blind phone expert.

RIVER PHOENIX as Carl Arbogast
==============================
River Phoenix plays the young hacker.

BEN KINGSLEY as Cosmo
=====================
Ben Kingsley plays the villain.
